            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800280/extras/a78e83d9c1fa44db4eca4d9f2699ec91.avif?t=1777584256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800280/extras_big/a78e83d9c1fa44db4eca4d9f2699ec91.avif?t=1777584256 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Renegade Pack features a unique and exclusive set of in-game cosmetics ranging from ship styles to prospector outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to really stand out and show off your defiance in the Reach? Here's your chance. Become a renegade..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For full details see below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renegade Pack includes the following Reach Renegade themed in-game cosmetics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 x Ship Style (Bastion, Hunter, Privateer and Scout)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 x Prospector Outfit (Adrian, Ion, Kae, Mophs, Sal, Sammo and Venture) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 x Helm Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 x Probe Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 x Probe Station Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 x Processor Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 x Reactor Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 x Turret Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> Renegade Pack does not automatically unlock ships or prospectors from purchase. These can be earned by completing in-game adventure tracks.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800280/extras/a78e83d9c1fa44db4eca4d9f2699ec91.avif?t=1777584256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800280/extras_big/a78e83d9c1fa44db4eca4d9f2699ec91.avif?t=1777584256 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Renegade Pack features a unique and exclusive set of in-game cosmetics ranging from ship styles to prospector outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to really stand out and show off your defiance in the Reach? Here's your chance. Become a renegade..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For full details see below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renegade Pack includes the following Reach Renegade themed in-game cosmetics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 x Ship Style (Bastion, Hunter, Privateer and Scout)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 x Prospector Outfit (Adrian, Ion, Kae, Mophs, Sal, Sammo and Venture) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 x Helm Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 x Probe Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 x Probe Station Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 x Processor Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 x Reactor Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 x Turret Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> Renegade Pack does not automatically unlock ships or prospectors from purchase. These can be earned by completing in-game adventure tracks.</p>",
